    "response": "{\"decision\":\"established_flaw\",\"issues\":[{\"category\":\"unsupported_inference\",\"target_kind\":\"assertion\",\"claim_quote\":\"Every displayed source presents the same severe and unresolved version of policy debate.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_fd4d06a8e6835d77\",\"quote\":\"I say to the hon. Gentleman exactly what I have said in answer to the other questions that I have been asked on this matter. As a Government, we are very clear that the brightest and the best should be able to come here...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_389569eed569ff6a\",\"quote\":\"I recently met the chief officer of the special constabulary in Bedfordshire...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_2dc0f10ad5fbeb17\",\"quote\":\"All hon. Members should encourage employers in their constituencies to allow people who work for them to become specials...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_206e0217847771c0\",\"quote\":\"A growing number of my constituents are victims of cyber-crime...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_2dc0f10ad5fbeb17\",\"quote\":\"The specials in my constituency of Hemel Hempstead do a fantastic job...\"}],\"whole_packet_no_support\":\"whole_packet_no_support\",\"mechanism\":\"The sources present diverse policy debates, contradicting the claim of a single, severe, and unresolved version.\",\"material_consequence\":\"The claim falsely asserts a uniform policy debate perspective, ignoring the varied concerns and discussions presented across the sources.\",\"counterconditions\":\"The sources cover distinct policy areas and perspectives, demonstrating a lack of a single, dominant debate.\"}],\"unresolved\":[],\"rationale\":\"The evidence demonstrates that the sources present multiple, distinct versions of policy debate, directly contradicting the claim of a single, severe, and unresolved version. The sources cover a range of topics and concerns, indicating a lack of uniformity in the debate.\"}",
